    {
      "issue": "COMPUTE_CAPACITY_EXHAUSTED",
      "evidence": "Reproduced under fail-on-contention with one slot. Both mock integration and live bounded-wait execution complete sequentially.",
      "fix": "Local policy now uses wait with 30000ms deadline; concurrency remains 1."
    },
    {
      "issue": "Opaque model readiness failures",
      "evidence": "Rerun returned CLI_USAGE_UNAVAILABLE; sanitized inspection identified HTTP 429 from the usage endpoint. The original NO_ELIGIBLE_MODEL lacked exclusions, so its precise cause remains unprovable.",
      "fix": "Share one fresh account inspection across discovery/models/preflight. Original usage expiry remains capped at 30 seconds. Cache 429 as unavailable for 30 seconds; report safe diagnostic code and retain selection exclusions."
    },
    {
      "issue": "Tail-only answer and hidden CLI continuation",
      "evidence": "Installed CLI 2.1.285 assigns final result from last assistant text. Live probe observed two public assistant blocks and result equal to the second, with repeated boundary words. A second probe exposed max_tokens and returned the original prefix with finishReason length.",
      "fix": "Retain public assistant blocks without duplicate result; consume partial stop events and terminate child at first output limit, returning length. Discard reasoning and diagnostics. Add budget-derived word target, without raising 384/768 token limits."
    }
  ],
